  <Lines>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 668c08530be223b44883e3880f11ee48, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d35d0e1530830e42b12a5e80d0329dc, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - " Oui bien s\xFBr c\u2019est ce que je vous dit."
    - "Si \xE7a ne change pas, tout le monde va finir par tomber malade."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Oh ! Je pensais pas que ce serait si important\u2026"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 668c08530be223b44883e3880f11ee48, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Bien s\xFBr que c\u2019est important, tu devrais prendre ton r\xF4le plus
